ny case (upper or lower).</p></div><div class="sample-tests"><div class="section-title">Example</div><div class="sample-test"><div class="input"><div class="title">Input<div title="Copy" data-clipboard-target="#id00691629001954637" id="id006193073945592292" class="input-output-copier">Copy</div></div><pre id="id00691629001954637">3
